[10168]="7000EF79\n1\tBring the provisions to Oiva\030Reclaim provisions (total: 15)\tSearch south of Karhu-leiri for the scattered provisions of the Lossoth.\n",
[10169]="70046C1F\n1\tDefeat Orcs in Bâr Aroth (total: 12)\030Destroy skull-piles in Bâr Aroth (total: 8)\030Destroy Orkish axes (total: 8)\tBâr Aroth can be found to the north of the Cross-roads in North Ithilien. Orcs have claimed the areas surrounding it as well. Thurindol has asked you to aid in reclaiming the ruins of North Ithilien. You should rout the Orcs and clear the ruins of their filth.\n2\tTalk to Thurindol at Aelin Veren\tThurindol can be found at Aelin Veren to the north of Bâr Aroth. You have aided in reclaiming the southern ruins of North Ithilien. You should meet with Thurindol at Aelin Veren and bring tidings of your efforts.\n",
