[10175]="70058460\n1\tRetrieve healing supplies from stolen crates (total: 5)\tHanksar-mokh is located to the west of Drenghól. You should retrieve the healing supplies from stolen crates across their encampment. Thrúthug believes you'll find the crates near their camp-fires.\n2\tDeliver the supplies to Thrúthug\tYou have retrieved the remaining healing supplies. You should bring them to Thrúthug at Drenghól.\n",
